901966", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 100, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$META Zuckerberg: If you want to get rich, just buy our suppliers!\n\n1. NVIDIA ($NVDA)\n\nThe undisputed leader in AI computing power and a key supplier of the millions of Blackwell and Rubin GPUs Meta is deploying. NVIDIA captures a major share of Meta’s budget, as well as spending", "url": "https://x.com/MAVEGAO/status/2117337680333901966"}, {"author_id": "1550851775527153665", "created_at": "2026-11-02T11:14:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117213645557866815"], "id": "2117213645557866815", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "[반도체 후공정 / 산업분석]\n제목: 반도체 후공정: 생산 증가에 주목해야 할 때\n작성자: 이건재, 강민구 (IBK투자증권)\n작성일: 2026.11.02\n투자의견: (리포트 내 미제시)\n\n[메모리 투자의 키워드는 가격에서 물량으로]\n· 반도체 사이클의 다음 내러티브는 '물량(Q)' 증가에 있으며, 이는 증설 이후", "url": "https://x.com/Chrisinko9/status/2117213645557866815"}, {"author_id": "1838186195508969472", "created_at": "2026-11-01T00:08:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116683815653654922"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 6, "start": 0, "tag": "ASMIY"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/50qawNmq58", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheValueist/status/2116683815653654922/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116683773396013056", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/50qawNmq58"}]}, "id": "2116683815653654922", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 3679, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$ASMIY KEY READ-THROUGHS FROM ASM INTERNATIONAL’S Q3 2026 EARNINGS CALL\n\nASM’s October 28 earnings call supports a prolonged, increasingly technology-intensive semiconductor investment cycle, but not an indiscriminate bullish conclusion for every participant. The most valuable https://t.co/50qawNmq58", "url": "https://x.com/TheValueist/status/2116683815653654922"}, {"author_id": "1332419203324928002", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:15:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117244109023019446"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "As increasingly large AI accelerators strain advanced packaging capacity, TSMC’s CoWoS supply remains tight. According to supply chain sources cited b...", "display_url": "trendforce.com/news/2026/10/2…", "end": 264, "expanded_url": "https://www.trendforce.com/news/2026/10/27/news-tsmc-reportedly-eyes-20-cowos-price-hike-skips-equipment-price-renegotiations-amid-ai-demand-surge/", "images": [{"height": 265, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114906711576530944/JzVEQZOm?format=png&name=orig", "width": 624}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114906711576530944/JzVEQZOm?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 241, "status": 200, "title": "[News] TSMC Reportedly Eyes 20% CoWoS Price Hike, Skips Equipment Price Renegotiations Amid AI Demand Surge", "unwound_url": "https://www.trendforce.com/news/2026/10/27/news-tsmc-reportedly-eyes-20-cowos-price-hike-skips-equipment-price-renegotiations-amid-ai-demand-surge/", "url": "https://t.co/RvJMwLbEwP"}]}, "id": "2117244109023019446", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC is reportedly considering higher CoWoS packaging prices as demand for AI chips continues to grow.\n\nFaster chips are only part of the story. Packaging capacity and testing are becoming just as important to getting them into production.\n\nhttps://t.co/RvJMwLbEwP", "url": "https://x.com/DilaraOmay/status/2117244109023019446"}, {"author_id": "1930923690604351488", "created_at": "2026-11-01T09:56:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116831675149848986"], "id": "2116831675149848986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 847, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ว้าวุ่นของจริง!! สื่อไต้หวันรายงานว่า เทคโนโลยี EMIB ของ Intel มีอัตราผลผลิต (Yield) โดยรวมอยู่ที่ประมาณ 60–65% แต่เฉพาะขั้นตอนการฝังชิป Silicon Bridge ลงในแผ่นวงจร ABF Substrate กลับมี Yield เพียง 25–30% เท่านั้น\n\nตัวเลขดังกล่าวต่ำกว่าเทคโนโลยี CoWoS ของ TSMC อย่างมาก ซึ่งมี", "url": "https://x.com/naklongpoong/status/2116831675149848986"}, {"author_id": "1920856401318211587", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:34:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117037620588855740"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Insightful Analysis and Commentary for U.S. and Global Equity Investors", "display_url": "247wallst.com", "end": 29, "expanded_url": "https://247wallst.com", "images": [{"height": 256, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117037621520060416/MWEazSEN?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 256}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117037621520060416/MWEazSEN?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 6, "status": 200, "title": "24/7 Wall St.", "unwound_url": "https://247wallst.com", "url": "https://t.co/FHdIJrkeBz"}, {"description": "Beth Kindig on X: “RT @Beth_Kindig: TSMC $TSM is reportedly planning to increase CoWoS packaging prices by…”", "display_url": "tinyurl.com/22vc9ceb", "end": 202, "expanded_url": "https://tinyurl.com/22vc9ceb", "images": [{"height": 1260, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117037626251259905/CmEu9f5T?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2400}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117037626251259905/CmEu9f5T?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 179, "status": 200, "title": "TSMC Plans Up to 20% CoWoS Price Hike, Squeezing AI Chip Makers", "unwound_url": "https://247wallst.com/cards/tsm-xpost-01m69ndp3x7w5mvdrcb8nmszrx", "url": "https://t.co/QkUdYZG4u9"}]}, "id": "2117037620588855740", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Según https://t.co/FHdIJrkeBz, TSMC planea elevar hasta un 20% los costos de su tecnología de empaquetado CoWoS para 2025, impactando la producción de chips de IA. Detalles aquí: https://t.co/QkUdYZG4u9", "url": "https://x.com/quees_ia/status/2117037620588855740"}, {"author_id": "1947150597104517120", "created_at": "2026-11-02T03:13:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117092610955248117"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 196, "start": 191, "tag": "NVDA"}], "urls": [{"description": "Scarcity rents flow to TSMC and memory makers; looser supply changes the math for Nvidia, SK hynix and Micron.", "display_url": "post.kapualabs.com/2p8uwt6n", "end": 220, "expanded_url": "https://post.kapualabs.com/2p8uwt6n", "start": 197, "status": 200, "title": "Nvidia's Binding Constraint: Who Wins When Supply Loosens", "unwound_url": "https://nova.kapualabs.com/nvda-stock_panel_c/when-supply-loosens-bull-and-bear-cases-across-nvidias-supply-chain/?utm_source=x", "url": "https://t.co/qa7uwd1pXV"}]}, "id": "2117092610955248117", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nvidia’s demand is not the puzzle; capacity is. This analysis traces the constraint through CoWoS and HBM, then explains why investors may be pricing 2027–28 supply growth before it arrives. #NVDA https://t.co/qa7uwd1pXV", "url": "https://x.com/kapualabs/status/2117092610955248117"}, {"author_id": "2116862138102726656", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:28:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116870101383237932"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 209, "start": 191, "tag": "AdvancedPackaging"}, {"end": 225, "start": 210, "tag": "Semiconductors"}], "mentions": [{"end": 8, "id": "2803191", "start": 2, "username": "intel"}], "urls": [{"description": "AI chips, memory & high-speed networking, verified. GPUs, ASICs, HBM/DRAM, NAND & SSD controllers, switches, CPO, foundry & packaging. Every item checked on primary sources.", "display_url": "t.me/SiliconBriefAI", "end": 257, "expanded_url": "https://t.me/SiliconBriefAI", "images": [{"height": 320, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116863342187106304/4FBLjGPd?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 320}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116863342187106304/4FBLjGPd?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 234, "status": 200, "title": "@SiliconBriefAI", "unwound_url": "https://t.me/SiliconBriefAI", "url": "https://t.co/4oiYNpAdgp"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/vlgUthSkN0", "end": 281, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SiliconBriefAI/status/2116870101383237932/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116870088431226880", "start": 258, "url": "https://t.co/vlgUthSkN0"}]}, "id": "2116870101383237932", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🧩 @intel EMIB yields: investors cited by Economic Daily News put overall yield at ~60-65%, and 25-30% for embedding bridges in ABF substrates.\nTSMC CoWoS: ~98%, still the main supply source.\n#AdvancedPackaging #Semiconductors\n\nMore 👉 https://t.co/4oiYNpAdgp https://t.co/vlgUthSkN0", "url": "https://x.com/SiliconBriefAI/status/2116870101383237932"}, {"author_id": "1810526133609529344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:04:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117226348691534211"], "id": "2117226348691534211", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC just dropped 38.8 billion Taiwan dollars to acquire AUO's Taichung plant facilities. This marks TSMC's second major buyout of display manufacturing assets, following its earlier deal with Innolux.\n\nThe real driver here is the push into next-generation CoPoS panel-level", "url": "https://x.com/3chuanguli/status/2117226348691534211"}, {"author_id": "2955103020", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:59:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116862762466836632"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 153, "start": 148, "tag": "INTC"}, {"end": 171, "start": 167, "tag": "TSM"}]}, "id": "2116862762466836632", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 116, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Pre-Market Wire\n\nIntel's EMIB packaging reportedly yields 60-65% overall, but only 25-30% on the bridge-embedding step vs about 98% for TSMC CoWoS. $INTC isn't a real $TSM alternative yet.\n\nIran talks hit day 3 in Doha. The UAE says Hormuz must go back to how it was before 28", "url": "https://x.com/JayHCapital/status/2116862762466836632"}, {"author_id": "1269514296054054913", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:54:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117148442158084293"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/jBIbw1oSEm", "end": 188, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/userHandle/status/2117148442158084293/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117148432074997760", "start": 165, "url": "https://t.co/jBIbw1oSEm"}]}, "id": "2117148442158084293", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CoWoS 供應瓶頸下，Intel EMIB-T 浮現替代路線\nAI 晶片愈來愈依賴多晶片與 HBM，封裝供應可能成為效能之外的限制。Prismark 指出，部分設計業者正評估 Intel EMIB-T，作為 CoWoS 以外的選項；但兩者較可能形成分工，而非全面互相取代。\n\n兩者同屬 2.5D 封裝，核心架構不同。CoWoS https://t.co/jBIbw1oSEm", "url": "https://x.com/userHandle/status/2117148442158084293"}, {"author_id": "1691437880605106176", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:14:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117047568991752366"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 45, "start": 41, "tag": "TSM"}], "hashtags": [{"end": 124, "start": 120, "tag": "台積電"}, {"end": 130, "start": 125, "tag": "TSMC"}, {"end": 137, "start": 131, "tag": "CoWoS"}, {"end": 141, "start": 138, "tag": "費半"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Zxtq4nS783", "end": 165, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PrinceHans9630/status/2117047568991752366/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117047560934420480", "start": 1